flowchart TD
  A[Customer browses product catalog] --> B[Add items to cart]
  B --> C[Create Stripe PaymentIntent when card payment is selected]
  C --> D[Customer confirms payment with a Stripe test card]
  D --> E[Frontend submits checkout]
  E --> F[Backend verifies payment and creates order]
  F --> G[(SQL Server stores order)]
  F --> H[Application sends order status notifications]
